      "message": "[warning] Line 166: 🟡 `gnutls.pc` is generated with `prefix` set to `${CURRENT_INSTALLED_DIR}`, which bakes an absolute install-tree path into the package metadata. This is fragile for binary caching/relocation and non-default install roots. Generate with `${CURRENT_PACKAGES_DIR}` semantics (or a relocatable prefix pattern) before `vcpkg_fixup_pkgconfig()` so the final `.pc` stays portable.",
