      "message": "[warning] Line 187: 🟡 The CMake wrapper is installed under `share/gnutls`, but this port is named `shiftmedia-libgnutls`. In vcpkg, wrappers are expected under the port’s share directory, so this can make the wrapper ineffective for dependency consumers. Install it under `share/shiftmedia-libgnutls` (or `${CURRENT_PACKAGES_DIR}/share/${PORT}`) and keep package-name/lookup behavior consistent.",
